<template><div class="builder-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" :aria-labelledby="`${mode}-title`" @click.self="$emit('close')"><section ref="dialog" tabindex="-1"><header><div><span>Frontend demonstration</span><h2 :id="`${mode}-title`">{{ title }}</h2></div><button aria-label="Close" @click="$emit('close')">×</button></header><template v-if="mode==='import'"><p>Load the built-in example to preview mapping an OBS setup. No file or setting will be changed.</p><div class="finding-grid"><div><strong>6</strong><span>Scenes found</span></div><div><strong>4</strong><span>Browser sources</span></div><div><strong>1920 × 1080</strong><span>Canvas</span></div></div><label v-for="name in findings.sceneNames.slice(0,5)" :key="name">{{ name }}<select><option>Map to {{ name }}</option><option>Do not import</option></select></label><button class="modal-primary" @click="$emit('complete','Demo import complete · No OBS files or settings were changed')">Load example OBS setup</button></template><template v-else-if="mode==='export'"><p>Prepare a harmless local mapping summary. No OBS connection exists.</p><label>Scenes<select v-model="scope"><option value="current">Current scene</option><option value="all">All overlay scenes</option></select></label><label>Output strategy<select v-model="strategy"><option value="universal">Universal source</option><option value="separate">Separate scene sources</option></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" checked> Preserve existing OBS sources</label><label><input type="checkbox"> Replace Project Respawn demo mappings</label><button class="modal-primary" @click="$emit('complete','Demo export prepared · No OBS changes were made')">Prepare demo export</button></template><template v-else><p>Publishing will eventually create protected browser-source outputs through the future backend and overlay runtime.</p><ul><li>No overlay is currently published.</li><li>No live browser-source URL exists.</li><li>No OBS connection or plugin is active.</li></ul><button class="modal-primary" @click="$emit('complete','Ready for future publishing · Nothing is currently published')">Mark ready for future publishing</button></template></section></div></template>
<script setup>import{nextTick,onMounted,ref}from'vue';defineProps({mode:String,title:String,findings:{type:Object,default:()=>({sceneNames:[]})}});defineEmits(['close','complete']);const dialog=ref(null),scope=ref('current'),strategy=ref('universal');onMounted(async()=>{await nextTick();dialog.value?.focus()})</script>
